claims:
1. A method performed by a computer, the method comprising:
identifying, by the computer, a document that is stored on a server in a network and that includes a link that points to a linked document;
determining, by the computer, a rank of the linked document;
annotating, by the computer, the link within the identified document based on the determined rank, to form a modified document; and
providing, by the computer, the modified document to a user.

9. A method performed by a computer, the method comprising:
identifying, in a database, a document that includes a plurality of links, each of the plurality of links pointing to a corresponding document of a plurality of documents;
determining, by the computer, a rank of the corresponding document pointed to by each of one or more links of the plurality of links;
annotating, by the computer, the one or more links in the identified document based on the determined one or more ranks; and
providing, by the computer, the identified document with the annotated one or more links to a user.

15. A method performed by a computer, the method comprising:
identifying, by the computer, a plurality of first documents that include links that point to a plurality of second documents, one of the first documents including one or more links to one or more of the second documents;
determining, by the computer, ranks for the one or more second documents based on scores of the first documents that include links that point to the one or more second documents;
associating, by the computer, indicators of the determined ranks with the one or more links within the one of the first documents; and
providing, by the computer, the one of the first documents, with the indicators, to a user.

18. A method performed by a computer, the method comprising:
identifying, by the computer, a document in a database, where the document includes a plurality of links, each of the plurality of links pointing to a corresponding document of a plurality of documents;
determining, by the computer, a rank for each of one or more of the corresponding documents pointed to by one or more links of the plurality of links in the document;
annotating, by the computer, the one or more links based on the one or more determined ranks; and
providing, by the computer, the document with the annotated one or more links to a user.
